accTitle: Two migration paths preserve different assets
accDescr: Virtual-machine images become EC2 AMIs through import, while SMB files and permissions move through DataSync to FSx.
subgraph SOURCE[On premises]
  VM[VMware guest image]:::inputData
  SMB[SMB files and ACLs]:::inputData
end
VM --> IMPORT[VM Import / Export]
IMPORT --> AMI[Imported AMI]:::storage
AMI --> EC2[EC2 application servers]:::output
SMB --> SYNC[DataSync]
SYNC --> FSX[FSx for Windows]:::storage
EC2 -->|SMB access after cutover| FSX
